E.1 File-based data ingest
Create comma- or tab-separated files containing the data for your tables, and a Python script that feeds them into your database (replacing the direct data ingest mechanism from problem D.3). SQL load data infile can be used for this, or alternatively the script can process the file and then use insert into.

