E.2 Semantic data export
Write a Python script that runs select queries against your database and exports the content as a JSON-LD file containing an ABox matching your ontology. (Like the JSON-LD file from problem C.3.)

Problem E.2 is to be discussed at the presentation session (23.11. 9.15) by groups 4, 26, and 34.

